  "ingredients": [
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "1.5 cups warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "1 cup evaporated milk",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 eggs",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "7 cups all-purpose flour, divided",
    "0.25 cup shortening",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for frying",
    "0.25 cup confectioners' sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zVihS63oYJi2jOE2d3b_3pfmvGg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7179-beignets-ddmfs-0357-3x4-ingredients-fd3d41625d9745179c794678b787beaa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7179/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissolve yeast in warm water. Pour into a large bowl and stir in evaporated milk, white sugar, eggs, and salt. Add 4 cups flour and beat until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nY5Zu3IEexwfit-v_eWis6c955w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7179-beignets-ddmfs-0359-3x4-step-01-3c8afc88a65345d08b4c7b8f7040b3eb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7179/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in shortening. Mix in remaining 3 cups flour. Cover and refrigerate for at least 2 hours, or up to 24 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dZqVN9MzmRoRokZbYlChFWIcQII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7179-beignets-ddmfs-0360-3x4-step-02-2042888942884aee9c55e2f85f3634b3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7179/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough out on floured surface to 1/8-inch thick. Cut into 2 1/2-inch squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qcpjjfYvyM5pVZOtQk69rsR6taw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7179-beignets-ddmfs-0457-3x4-step-03-87d5dd4ce0624e1d8bbcb106aa51b5f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7179/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep pot to 360 degrees F (180 degrees C). Fry beignets in batches until browned and puffed. (If beignets sink and do not pop up, oil is not hot enough.) Remove from oil with a slotted spoon and drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D5PZLgE2DPw9zszmdavYxcHuXBU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7179-beignets-ddmfs-0464-3x4-step-04-2f48a440a0834353b1e8141349817d4c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7179/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shake confectioners' sugar over hot beignets. Serve immediately. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hKFUyVfr92RDNlZyBUoR1xMkk4M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7179-beignets-VAT-014-4x3-205f030f178a42c48a0e04b17d4e94f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7179/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
